@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Assertion rewriting now "unrolls" ``all(...)`` and ``any(...)`` calls whose
+argument is a generator expression or comprehension, so that the failure
+report points at the element which caused the assertion to fail instead of
+showing the opaque truth value of the call.
